---
description: Commit and push completed work to main without asking
alwaysApply: true
---

After completing implementation work (not question-only or review-only tasks), commit and push to `main` without asking for confirmation.

- Stage relevant changed files; do not commit secrets (.env, credentials).
- Write a concise commit message focused on why.
- Push to `origin main` after a successful commit.
- Skip commit/push when there are no changes, or when the user explicitly says not to.
